<title>JAPAN: Kyushu Electric - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kyushu Electric - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		703.99		vs	  722.61</p>
<p> Operating	   98.76		vs	  102.88</p>
<p> Current	     30.02		vs	   38.83</p>
<p> Net		   16.48		vs	   21.34</p>
<p> EPS		   34.76 yen	  vs	   45.00 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    474 million	  vs	 469 million</p>
<p> Interim div	 25.00 yen	  vs	   25.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Kyushu Electric Power Co Inc supplies Kyushu island.</p>
